24	/**
25	 * THE location template: every generated "(location) (service)" landing the
26	 * live site serves from app/(marketing)/[slug] (region tier, city matrix,
27	 * general per-location pages, game x location matrix) plus the five
28	 * hand-routed Singapore landers, served under /nxm by app/nxm/[slug].
29	 *
30	 * - WHICH pages exist, and every word of their copy (titles, H1, intro, why,
31	 *   steps, FAQ, related links, the honesty framing per `presence`), comes from
32	 *   the live builders in lib/marketing/locationLandings.ts and
33	 *   lib/marketing/gameLocationLandings.ts — so the new site says exactly what
34	 *   the live pages say and never claims a datacenter or latency Nxeon doesn't
35	 *   have. Unknown slugs 404.
36	 * - Prices/plans: db.plan (VPS-shaped services), db.hostingPlan (web),
37	 *   db.gamePlan (game servers) at request time; the builders' "from $X" is
38	 *   fed the same rows. Empty tables throw (the builders would otherwise fall
39	 *   back to a hardcoded "$6.49").
40	 * - Regions: enabled db.node rows drive the map, distances, stats and every
41	 *   deploy link (a link only ever targets an enabled region). The live copy
